==Trivia==
*Doctor K.O. is a literal [[wikipedia:Red kangaroo|red kangaroo]], the largest species of kangaroo and the largest extant marsupial. Females are smaller and faster than males and have a blue-gray-hued coat, giving them the nickname "blue fliers".
*Judging by their hairstyle, mustache, [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] trait and how the name K.O. starts with a "K", Doctor K.O. may be a reference to communist philosopher [[wikipedia:Karl Marx|Karl Marx]]. Their large, curved tail is shaped like the blade of the sickle in the communist [[wikipedia:Hammer and sickle|hammer and sickle]], but faces left instead of right; this can best be seen 4 frames into their walking animation, when their tail is curved the most. They also appear in [[Pop-pop Wonderland]] alongside [[CTO Seal]], an enemy from [[Worker's Revolution (Monthly Event)|Worker's Revolution]].
**Ironically, Doctor K.O. is introduced in a [[Candy Paradise|food-themed sub-chapter]].
*Doctor K.O. and [[Ms. Madonna]] are the only [[Kang Roo]] variants that don't have a [[wikipedia:Marsupial#Early development|joey]].

